# Deploy rollback snapshots. `aegis deploy` writes these into the deploy
# directory on the host, which IS the build context there. Without this
# entry `COPY . /code` bakes every retained snapshot into the image, and
# since the copied bytes change on each deploy the layer is rebuilt every
# time. Left unignored on aegis-pulse this reached 2.5 GB of a 3.65 GB
# image and helped fill a 77 GB droplet.
backups/